OL,3,GNEWSA'We still feel unsafe in
OL,4,Aflood-prone town'
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents in a town devastated by a
OL,7,Fstorm three years ago said they still
OL,8,Ffelt unsafe and not truly protected
OL,9,Ffrom the risks of future flooding.
OL,11,FOn 20 October 2023, Storm Babet
OL,12,Fresulted in many homes and businesses
OL,13,Fbeing flooded in Suffolk, along with
OL,14,Fcountless schools closed and roads
OL,15,Fsubmerged.
OL,17,FSince then, local councils and agencies
OL,18,Fsaid they had carried out work to
OL,19,Fbetter safeguard parts of the county
OL,20,Fand support those affected.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
