OL,3,GNEWSA'We still feel unsafe in
OL,4,Aflood-prone town'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut homeowners in Framlingham, which
OL,7,Fbore the brunt of the destructive
OL,8,Fweather along with Debenham, believed
OL,9,Fthere was "a lot of progress yet to be
OL,10,Fmade".
